{"suttaId":"sn46.71","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-v","vriCode":"s0305m.mul","paras":[779,779],"vripara":"252"},"segments":{"sn46.71:0.3":"Aniccasuttaṃ","sn46.71:1.1":"“Aniccasaññā, bhikkhave … pe …","sn46.71:1.2":"pañcamaṃ."},"unsure":[],"attha":{"book":"Spk-v","bookName":"Mahāvagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0305a.att","from":303,"to":307,"paras":[{"para":303,"vripara":"248-257","refs":["sn46.71:1"],"lines":["248-257. <b>Asubhasaññā</b>ti asubhe paṭhamajjhānasaññā.","<b>Maraṇasaññā</b>ti “avassaṃ maritabbaṃ, maraṇapaṭibaddhaṃ me jīvitan”ti abhiṇhaṃ paccavekkhantassa uppannasaññā.","<b>Āhāre paṭikūlasaññā</b>ti odanakummāsādimhi ajjhoharaṇīye paṭikūlasaññā.","<b>Sabbaloke anabhiratisaññā</b>ti sakalalokasmiṃ anabhiratiṃ uppādentassa uppannasaññā.","<b>Pahānasaññāvirāgasaññā</b>ti dve pubbabhāgā.","<b>Nirodhasaññā</b> missakā.","Evametāni aṭṭhikasaññādīni vīsati kammaṭṭhānāni niddiṭṭhāni.","Tesaṃ navasu appanā honti, ekādasa upacārajjhānikā.","Sesā panettha vinicchayakathā visuddhimagge (visuddhi.1.294) āgatāva.","Gaṅgāpeyyālādayo maggasaṃyutte vuttanayeneva veditabbā."],"lineRefs":[["sn46.71:1"],["sn46.71:1"],["sn46.71:1"],["sn46.71:1"],["sn46.71:1"],["sn46.71:1"],["sn46.71:1"],["sn46.71:1"],["sn46.71:1"],["sn46.71:1"]]},{"para":304,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn46.71:1"],"lines":["Bojjhaṅgasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn46.71:1"]]},{"para":305,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn46.71:1"],"lines":["Satipaṭṭhānasaṃyuttaṃ"],"lineRefs":[["sn46.71:1"]]},{"para":306,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn46.71:1"],"lines":["Ambapālivaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn46.71:1"]]},{"para":307,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn46.71:1"],"lines":["Ambapālisuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn46.71:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-v","bookName":"Mahāvagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0305t.tik","from":299,"to":304,"paras":[{"para":299,"vripara":"248-257","refs":["sn46.71:1"],"lines":["248-257. <b>Anabhiratin</b>ti anabhiramaṇaṃ anapekkhitaṃ.","Accantanirodhabhūte nibbāne pavattasaññā <b>nirodhasaññā</b>.","Tattha sā maggasahagatā lokuttarā, yā pana nibbāne ninnabhāvena pavattā, upasamānussatisahagatā ca, sā lokiyāti āha –","<b>“nirodhasaññā missakā”</b>ti.","“Tesaṃ navasū”tiādi pamādapāṭho.","“Ekādasasu appanā hoti, nava upacārajjhānikā”ti pāṭho gahetabbo.","<b>Vīsati kammaṭṭhānānī</b>ti idampi idhāgatanayo, na visuddhimaggādīsu āgatanayo.","Ettha ca ārammaṇādīsu yathāyogaṃ appanaṃ upacāraṃ vā pāpuṇitvā arahattappattassa pubbabhāgabhūtā vipassanāmaggabojjhaṅgā kathitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn46.71:1"],["sn46.71:1"],["sn46.71:1"],["sn46.71:1"],["sn46.71:1"],["sn46.71:1"],["sn46.71:1"],["sn46.71:1"]]},{"para":300,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn46.71:1"],"lines":["Nirodhavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn46.71:1"]]},{"para":301,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn46.71:1"],"lines":["Bojjhaṅgasaṃyuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn46.71:1"]]},{"para":302,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn46.71:1"],"lines":["Satipaṭṭhānasaṃyuttaṃ"],"lineRefs":[["sn46.71:1"]]},{"para":303,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn46.71:1"],"lines":["Ambapālivaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn46.71:1"]]},{"para":304,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn46.71:1"],"lines":["Ambapālisuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn46.71:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
